# Allow-list build context: everything is excluded unless re-included below.
# The runtime Dockerfile copies only src/, db/ and webapp/ into the image. The
# remaining entries are what the deps stage and the test image
# (docker/test/Dockerfile, which runs the repository's own gates) need. Local
# working material, env files, caches, the agent-task registry and editor state
# never reach the daemon. Verified by scripts/check_build_context.py.
*

# Build inputs
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!uv.lock

# Shipped trees
!src/
!db/
!webapp/

# Test-image inputs (the suite asserts on these files)
!scripts/
!tests/
!docker/
!config/
!nginx/
!docs/
!admin-console/
!static/fixtures/
!static/images/
!.github/
!docker-compose*.yml
!.dockerignore
!.gitignore
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
!.release-audit-allow.txt
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example
!.env.test.example
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!AGENTS.md
!PURPOSE.md
!DISCLAIMER.md
!Makefile
!engineering_decisions.yml
!engineering/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed trees
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
admin-console/dist/
